\item[S2] Y. Cheng and A. Sgueglia, The perfect 1-factorisation conjecture holds asymptotically, arXiv:2607.09459 (2026). \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.09459}. Bibliographic information imported from the supplied record.

\end{itemize}

}

